# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000007> (mouth movement)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000007> "The act of moving any of the tissues and hard structures surrounding the mouth other than teeth, jaws or filter structures [NBO:AC]")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000007> "2011-04-14T01:03:39Z")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000007> "George Gkoutos")
