AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000011> "\"A behavior that occurs predominantly or only, in individuals that are part of a group.\" [Wikipedia:Social_behavior]")
